<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Timeline — Tiananmen Square Events, April–June 1989</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f7f5f0;
    --ink: #2b2b2b;
